iga-surface3d-quad.out
3D IGA surface (bspline3dsurfaceelement): bilinear patch in a tilted plane against QuadSurface
StaticStructural nsteps 2 deltat 1.0 rtolv 1.e-12 maxiter 20 manrmsteps 1 nmodules 1
errorcheck
domain 3d
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_all element_all
ndofman 12 nelem 3 ncrosssect 1 nmat 1 nbc 2 nic 0 nltf 1 nset 2
# Nodes 1-6: control points of a bilinear B-spline patch with two knot spans in u (u index fastest);
# nodes 7-12: the same points for two QuadSurface elements. The plane is rotated by 0.9 rad about
# (2, -1, 1.5). Degree 1 B-splines are the bilinear Lagrange functions of each knot span and the 2 x 2
# Gauss points coincide, so both models must give the same solution.
node 1 coords 3 0.1 0.2 -0.3
node 2 coords 3 0.9593381782422356 0.6325768797221647 0.24260034882512932
node 3 coords 3 1.760753764656458 0.8639940182611983 0.5949909926321886
