bspline3dsurfaceelement 1 nodes 6 1 2 3 4 5 6 crosssect 1 knotvectoru 3 0 0.5 1 knotvectorv 2 0 1 degree 2 1 1 nip 4 nlgeo 1
quadsurface 2 nodes 4 7 8 11 10 crosssect 1 nlgeo 1
quadsurface 3 nodes 4 8 9 12 11 crosssect 1 nlgeo 1
simplesurfacecs 1 material 1
surfacetensionmat 1 gamma1 0.3 alpha1 0.2 mu 1.0 lambda 0.5 d 1.0
